'''Hidden Forest of Gapra''' (ガープラ密林, ''Gāpura Mitsurin'', '''Gapura Jungle''') is a [[Behemoth Culling]] map added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] and unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. It drops Purple and Red [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stones]] more consistently than [[Ashvini Desert]] and [[Jinfore Volcano]], but is limited to those two colors until stage 11 and is a good place to obtain those two colors of Behemoth Stones as the drop rates and amount compared to Ashvini Desert and Jinfore Volcano are much higher. in terms of [[Ototo Corps|materials]], stages 1-4 can drop either Bricks or Feathers. After clearing any stage in Hidden Forest of Gapra, the map will disappear until the next day.

