==Trivia==
*Like [[Ashvini Desert]] and [[Jinfore Volcano]], Hidden Forest of Gapra is named after a breed of cat, in this case the [[wikipedia:Singapura cat|Singapura]] (in Japanese, Gapra is written as ガープラ and Singapura is シン<u>ガプーラ</u>).

